{
  "name": "task_plan",
  "description": "Split code, repo research and multi-step work; check machines_list, KB, agents_list, preferences. Main/lead, readonly, user_requested and preapproved start now; others/owner_step need 开始. Queued=dispatched. Reuse suggested idle Agents via agent_send (even after closure) if context/permissions fit. Keep reminders/events separate.\n\nExplicit machine: fixed (default, refuses unavailable launchers) or flexible (health-based moves, explain why); omit for auto placement with placement_constraints. Leads own tasks; main owns its own, receives needs_user, may pick a lead (agent_transfer persists); incompatible leads need supervision_policy. Check supervisor, similar work, active same-dir Agents; pass todo_id for unassigned to-dos. Issue/PR URLs in title/goal/prompt block open duplicates: use continues, todo_id or distinct_from (other hints advisory).\n\nStarted tasks keep a hub brief (owner request/started_why). Give goal, done_when, out_of_bounds: writable needs done_when (PR/Issue defaults merged+closed unless PR/draft-only); readonly needs goal. expect_minutes: omit=auto, positive overrides. Use continues+continues_why, task_retry (failed starts), task_scope+scope_revision (approved changes).\n\nEdits need readonly=false+write permission; replace readonly Codex for fixes or use agent_send when permissions match. readonly=true adds readonly constraint (Claude/agy: bypassPermissions; Codex: plan unless assistant.readonly_mode=prompt; pi/cursor refuse). role=worker, or leader for direct workers via restricted task_plan/task_review.\n\nUse repositories_list/repository_get when needed; explicit repository URL or path takes precedence. Bindings never imply machine/cwd. Non-repository tasks need no lookup (not a mandatory dispatch preflight). Only owner closes terminals on acceptance.\n\nSaved workspace plan on existing todo: {\"backend\":{\"operation_id\":\"id\"}}. Multi-repo container: {\"container\":{\"selected_repo_ids\":[...]}} (or operation_id with todo_id). Optional host picks enabled engine; selected repos must be ready.\n\nWorkspace: \"new\" isolates; {\"new\":{\"branch\":\"task/my-change\"}} names it (default task/{todo id}); reuse needs a clean, unused checkout. {\"existing\":\"\u003ccwd or id\u003e\",\"queue\":true} selects it without switching; busy queues FIFO only if requested or owner waits. \"none\" creates nothing. Omitted: readonly=none, otherwise configured default or new when busy. Only the engine creates workspaces; failure stops dispatch, acceptance keeps them. Respect org read-only refusals.\n\n`wait_seconds` observes \u003c=50s after dispatch, appending `Inline observation` JSON (`completed`+`reply`, `question`+`interaction_id`, `timeout`/`cancelled`/`unavailable`/`interrupted`/`failed`, known input/session ids). Never answers, accepts, resends or cancels; `task_review` supervision applies. Older nodes may time out. Only one immediately dispatchable task waits; cards/multi-task return immediately.",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "required": [
      "tasks"
    ],
    "properties": {
      "wait_seconds": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 0,
        "description": "0/omitted: normal receipt"
      },
      "supervisor": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "optional leader id (assistant.leaders), selected by main; omitted: planning lead or main"
      },
      "tasks": {
        "type": "array",
        "minItems": 1,
        "maxItems": 8,
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "title",
            "prompt",
            "role",
            "readonly",
            "user_requested",
            "why"
          ],
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "required": [
                "cwd"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "workspace",
                "todo_id"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "workspace": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "backend"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "object",
              "required": [
                "workspace"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "workspace": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "container"
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "title": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Card title in Chinese, under 20 characters."
            },
            "context": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "extra facts; no project background"
            },
            "prompt": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "goal, bounds and facts; manager adds context, criteria and rules"
            },
            "skip_project_memory": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "default false; true skips project/direction memory in prompt"
            },
            "machine": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Machine id; omit for automatic placement."
            },
            "machine_policy": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "fixed",
                "flexible"
              ],
              "description": "fixed (default) or flexible (health-based moves for portable work)"
            },
            "placement_constraints": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "description": "Optional auto-placement constraints when machine is omitted.",
              "properties": {
                "os": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "linux",
                    "darwin",
                    "windows"
                  ]
                },
                "capabilities": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 16,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "require_hub": {
                  "type": "boolean",
                  "description": "default false (excludes hub)"
                },
                "workload": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "light",
                    "standard",
                    "heavy"
                  ]
                },
                "candidate_machines": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "maxItems": 32,
                  "items": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "cwd": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Abs or ~/ dir, unless workspace.backend/container supplies it."
            },
            "workspace": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "object"
              ],
              "description": "workspace policy; omit for default; existing: path or workspace id",
              "oneOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "new",
                    "none"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "backend"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "backend": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "required": [
                        "operation_id"
                      ],
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "operation_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "host": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "container"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "container": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "selected_repo_ids": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "minItems": 1,
                          "items": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "minLength": 1
                          }
                        },
                        "operation_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "minLength": 1
                        },
                        "host": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "existing"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "existing": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "minLength": 1
                    },
                    "queue": {
                      "type": "boolean"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "new"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "properties": {
                    "new": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "additionalProperties": false,
                      "properties": {
                        "branch": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "launcher": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "listed launcher; empty: default/fallback, claude first"
            },
            "host": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "agy (companion) or enabled engine"
            },
            "model": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "model id/alias; empty: launcher default"
            },
            "model_aliases": {
              "type": "object",
              "description": "Claude Code IDs: sonnet_model, haiku_model, opus_model, fable_model, subagent_model.",
              "additionalProperties": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "permission": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "default",
                "acceptEdits",
                "plan",
                "auto",
                "bypassPermissions"
              ],
              "description": "mode; empty: writable default; TRAE/omp take none"
            },
            "role": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "worker",
                "leader"
              ],
              "description": "worker or leader (starts/reviews direct workers)"
            },
            "ultracode": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "large tasks only (Claude Code 2.1.284+ multi-agent); small: false; never in prompt/title"
            },
            "multi_issue_report": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "Only for a report investigating several issues; requires a findings list before park or close."
            },
            "readonly": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "true only for read-only tasks; false for authorized edits. Adds「本任务只读：不改项目文件、不提交、不对外写入」when true"
            },
            "user_requested": {
              "type": "boolean",
              "description": "True only if user's latest message asked for it."
            },
            "owner_step": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "money",
                "outward",
                "irreversible"
              ],
              "description": "money, outward speech, or unagreed irreversible step"
            },
            "why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Chinese one-line reason for machine, directory and model."
            },
            "done_when": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 6,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Chinese checkable acceptance results told to Agent, one per entry. Nonempty for writable tasks; ignored with continues."
            },
            "goal": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Owner's one-line Chinese outcome. Required read-only; writable defaults to title."
            },
            "out_of_bounds": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 6,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Optional forbidden actions/areas, in Chinese, one per entry."
            },
            "continues": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Original todo id (needs continues_why); reuses todo/brief, stops prior Agents, reopens if closed."
            },
            "scope_revision": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "With continues after scope change: exact task_scope scope_revision."
            },
            "continues_why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "With continues: one-line replacement reason."
            },
            "distinct_from": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "todo_id",
                  "reason"
                ],
                "additionalProperties": false,
                "properties": {
                  "todo_id": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reason": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "minLength": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              "description": "new tasks only: explain each conflicting open todo. Reasons stay in the brief"
            },
            "started_why": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Non-owner-requested start reason saved in brief."
            },
            "attachments": {
              "type": "array",
              "maxItems": 8,
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "Abs paths of chat files (Claude/app); copied with updated mentions."
            },
            "expect_minutes": {
              "type": "integer",
              "minimum": 0,
              "description": "Optional minutes override (0/omit: auto or 60m)."
            },
            "project": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Existing kb_list projects slug/name; no near-duplicates."
            },
            "audience": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "human",
                "autonomous"
              ],
              "description": "Optional to-do audience."
            },
            "direction_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Direction id."
            },
            "part_of": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Request todo this is a piece of."
            },
            "after": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "description": "With part_of: prerequisite pieces."
            },
            "todo_id": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Caller's open/failed-start todo with no live Agent; equals continues if both set."
            },
            "inbox_item": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Inbox ID or 'none' to skip; omit to link sole eligible handoff (multiple need ID; none stays unlinked). Never files/replies."
            },
            "tier": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Agent preset from 模型档位; explicit launcher/model/effort/speed override."
            },
            "speed": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "standard",
                "fast",
                "ultrafast"
              ],
              "description": "new-start speed; standard/omitted: default; Codex: fast/ultrafast; Claude Code: fast"
            },
            "effort": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "Explicit effort; omit for tier/purpose default."
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
